    "comments": [
      {
        "anchor": "cmain",
        "date": "1 Dec 2023 7:29",
        "author": "JINSHENG BA",
        "text": "Description:\nCREATE TABLE t0(c0 INT, c1 INT);\nINSERT INTO t0(c1, c0) VALUES(0, 1);\n\nSELECT * FROM t0 WHERE t0.c1 IN (GREATEST(0.1, 0.2)); -- empty result\nCREATE INDEX i0 ON t0(c1);\nSELECT * FROM t0 WHERE t0.c1 IN (GREATEST(0.1, 0.2)); -- {1|0}\n\nThe same query returns different results with and without the index i0.\n\nHow to repeat:\ndocker run -it -p 3306:3306 -e MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=root mysql:8.2.0\n\nThen execute the above test case."
      },
      {
        "anchor": "c538579",
